      "content": "but what if it wasnt just a mistake tho? what if i actually am just a bad person at my core? like, some people are just broken and they end up hurting everyone they touch. i feel like the world would honestly just be lighter and better if i wasn't around to mess things up. it feels more like a fact than a feeling.",
